Subject: [PATCH 2/2] feat: Protect Event forms with a CSRF token

Adds Lib\Csrf (session token, hash_equals), the csrf_field() helper and the VerifyCsrf middleware (alias csrf). The csrf group wraps the auth group, so auth and admin run first; POST, PUT and DELETE without the right _token get 403, GET passes. Event forms and the remove button carry the token.
